00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,850
B.

2
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:08,970
Kitty and her classmates are talking about unusual schools in different countries.

3
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:14,220
Work in groups and share your opinions on this topic.

4
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:18,240
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:24,160
Do you know any unusual schools around the world?

6
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:29,510
Yes, I know about the boat school in Bangladesh.

7
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:37,150
During the rainy season there's much more rain in Bangladesh than in many other parts of the world.

8
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:44,020
Thanks to the boat school, children have a chance to learn even when there are floods.

9
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:48,140
What a good way to get the children learning!

10
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:52,460
Another example is the bottle school.

11
00:00:52,460 --> 00:01:00,960
People in the Philippines and Guatemala build this kind of school with used plastic bottles.

12
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:05,020
This is very cheap and good for the environment.

13
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,940
That's really cool!
